OL,3,GNEWSAMan suffers life-changing wound in
OL,4,Apolice shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA watchdog has launched an
OL,7,Finvestigation after a man suffered
OL,8,Flife-changing injuries following a
OL,9,Fpolice shooting.
OL,11,FShots were fired by armed officers at a
OL,12,Fproperty in Cardigan Street, Luton, at
OL,13,Fabout 12:50 BST on Tuesday.
OL,15,FBedfordshire Police said it was
OL,16,Fresponding to reports that a man was
OL,17,Fthreatening a woman with a knife at the
OL,18,Faddress. She had suffered a stab wound.
OL,20,FThe Independent Office for Police
OL,21,FConduct (IOPC) was investigating the
OL,22,Fpolice response, it added.
